  "question": {
    "text": "Air is filled in a bottle at atmospheric pressure and it is corked at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mn>C</mn></math>. If the cork can come out at a pressure&nbsp;<math><mn>3&nbsp;</mn></math>times the atmospheric pressure, then up to what temperature should the bottle be heated in order to remove the cork."
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>325.5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mn>C</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>851</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mn>C</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>651</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mn>C</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "None of these",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that, <math><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>273</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>308</mn></math> ....(i)<br /><br />and <math><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> ....(ii)<br /><br />On dividing Equation (ii) by Equation (i), we get<br /><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>308</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>924</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>K</mn></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>924</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>273</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>651</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mn>C</mn></math>"
  }
}